{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415735","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415735","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041573501:1":{"text":"으악! 물컵이 밖으로 날아갔잖아! 에테르 숲으로 떨어진 건 아니겠지...","source_cn":"糟了，你的水杯，飞出屋外了！不会落到空境森林里了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C016BA44A07AE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573502:1":{"text":"방금... 물컵이 날았어...?!","source_cn":"它是……自己飞起来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97656E2BF3992CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573503:1":{"text":"가벼운 바람으로 뜨거운 차를 식히려고 한 것뿐인데, 또 이 마법 변이 때문에... 정말 미안해...","source_cn":"我本来只是想用微风术把里面的热茶吹凉，但我的魔法总会突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6949A750559D726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573504:1":{"text":"아니야. 정말 대단한걸?","source_cn":"不会，你真厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB104C11091C7EFDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573505:1":{"text":"나도 치치를 연처럼 날려보고 싶었는데... 잘 안 되더라고.","source_cn":"我也试过让奇奇飞起来，像风筝那样……可惜飞不了太远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BD57068F8F412B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573506:1":{"text":"...치치? 내 설치류 친구들은 나를 피피라고 부르거든. 혹시 치치도 설치류야?","source_cn":"……奇奇？唔，我的啮齿类朋友们会叫我皮皮，难道奇奇也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD064017D4D952230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573507:1":{"text":"치치는 내 인형이야.","source_cn":"奇奇是我的玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4E476A759B56FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573508:1":{"text":"엄마가 선물해 주신... 내 가장 소중하고 친한 친구야.","source_cn":"它是妈妈送给我的，是我最好的朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE909FCA6667BC728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573509:1":{"text":"저기, 혹시... 이상하게 생각할 수도 있는데...","source_cn":"呃，虽然没有很明白，但你要是不嫌我麻烦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31604B936E059F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573510:1":{"text":"그게, 내가 며칠 전에 홀트 앨리 인형들 코를 죄다 무지개색으로 칠해버렸거든?","source_cn":"就、就比如前几天，我不小心把商业街上所有的玩偶鼻子都变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F191A326C1EB94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573511:1":{"text":"아니 뭐, 사장님은 “덕분에 코 칠할 수고 덜었다”면서 칭찬을... 해주시긴 했지만...","source_cn":"虽然老板夸我为他们节省了上色的时间……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B9871FC407D8E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573512:1":{"text":"우와! 치치가 말만 할 줄 알았으면 당장 같이 가겠다고 할걸?","source_cn":"哇！听起来真有趣，要是奇奇会说话，它一定会喜欢彩色的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C826BC0CB374E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573513:1":{"text":"역시... 이상하게 생각 안 할 줄 알았어! 우린 분명 좋은 친구가 될 거야!","source_cn":"那我们可以成为好朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x411BBA88F2352B05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573514:1":{"text":"친구...? 진짜?! 난 데이먼이라고 해. 너는? 피피라고 부르면 돼?","source_cn":"朋友……真的吗？我叫戴蒙，你呢，你叫皮皮吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6E8083E11266947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573515:1":{"text":"내 이름은 피파야. 근데 너가 피피라고 부르고 싶으면 피피라고 불러도 돼! 만나서 반가워, 데이먼!","source_cn":"我叫皮帕，叫我皮皮也行，很高兴认识你，戴蒙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x381C221261D054AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573516:1":{"text":"내일도 여기 올 거야? 너랑 같이 보트도 타고 낚시도 하고 싶거든.","source_cn":"明天你还会再来这里吗？我想和你一起去划船、钓鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB646DBA7AE16F142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573517:1":{"text":"피피의 마법은 대단하니까, 낚싯대가 없어도 물고기들이 알아서 튀어 오를지도 몰라!","source_cn":"皮皮的魔法那么厉害，说不定用不着出钩，湖里的鱼就都自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50AD21952AF16004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573518:1":{"text":"어... “낚시”, “보트”, “튀어 오른다”... 으으, 아주 안 좋은 기억이 떠오르는데...","source_cn":"啊……鱼……船……飞起来……我想起一些不好的回忆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD510D4B709D6862B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573519:1":{"text":"뭐, 어때! 네가 가고 싶다면야! 그래, 그럼 우리 내일 낚시하러 가자!","source_cn":"诶，不管了，戴蒙喜欢，我们就去钓鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0C16BA9E2369607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573520:1":{"text":"내일 솔리스 교수님이랑 다른 친구들도 다 불러올게. 분명 모두 데이먼을 좋아할 거야!","source_cn":"明天，我叫上娑丽丝老师，还有好多好多人一起来，他们一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824722D3A638667C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"피파","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"데이먼","source":"戴蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}